---
const integrations = [
  {
    icon: "💬",
    name: "WhatsApp",
    description: "Captación y seguimiento",
  },
  {
    icon: "📝",
    name: "Formularios",
    description: "Registro de prospectos",
  },
  {
    icon: "📅",
    name: "Calendario",
    description: "Agenda de citas",
  },
  {
    icon: "📊",
    name: "CRM",
    description: "Control de oportunidades",
  },
  {
    icon: "✉️",
    name: "Email",
    description: "Comunicación automatizada",
  },
  {
    icon: "📈",
    name: "Analytics",
    description: "Medición de resultados",
  },
];
---

<section class="relative py-16">
  <div
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1480px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 2xl:max-w-[1600px]"
  >
    <div
      class="rounded-[2rem] border border-blue-400/20 bg-[#061126]/60 p-6 shadow-[0_0_70px_rgba(37,99,235,0.12)] backdrop-blur-xl lg:p-8"
    >
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div
          class="mb-5 inline-flex rounded-full border border-blue-400/30 bg-blue-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-blue-300"
        >
          Integraciones
        </div>

        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl"
        >
          Conectamos tus herramientas favoritas
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300">
          Tu página no debe vivir aislada. Podemos conectarla con herramientas
          que ayuden a captar, organizar y dar seguimiento a tus prospectos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6"
      >
        {
          integrations.map((item) => (
            <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5 text-center transition hover:border-blue-300/40 hover:bg-blue-500/[0.06]">
              <div class="mx-auto flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-blue-400/20 bg-blue-500/10 text-2xl">
                {item.icon}
              </div>

              <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-extrabold text-white">
                {item.name}
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">
                {item.description}
              </p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
